 loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.poster.avif?t=1785356063\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.webm?t=1785356063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/1b93848d469429057f77576a88c531df.mp4?t=1785356063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stock, Sell &amp; Strategize</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You decide what your store is known for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you be the go-to place for high-end electronics, or the neighborhood favorite for everyday essentials?<br>Set prices, monitor what’s flying off the shelves, optimize shelf organization, and fine-tune your restocking strategy. Smart decisions lead to happy customers and a booming bottom line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.poster.avif?t=1785356063\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.webm?t=1785356063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614460/extras/4f167c28faa8aef02d2f07fbe965a130.mp4?t=1785356063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Expand &amp; Evolve</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start with a modest floor space and grow into a sprawling hypermarket.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your profits to expand the store, unlock new departments and product categories, and upgrade your equipment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step by step, turn your small shop into a full-scale <strong>retail empire</strong> built around smart planning and customer focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Uniquely Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Name your store, customize floors and walls, and make creative use of windows and doors to shape the perfect interior.<br>Add decorations, build dedicated staff areas and offices, and give your hypermarket its own personality, both on the shop floor and behind the scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step inside, grab your scanner, and see if you have what it takes to run the <strong>ultimate hypermarket.</strong></p>",
